; The Ashen Knight's first duel (Phase 47.5), at the Stormcrown after the Storm Tyrant falls.
; Summoned by the rival brazier there through BossSummonComponent.FightId over enemy.ashen_knight:
; the same knight, testing the player rather than trying to kill them. Slower than his Act IV self
; (attack speed -30%), one stance, and he YIELDS at 65% health (WithdrawHealthFraction): the fight
; ends on BossWithdrewEvent, flag.rival.duel1_won is set and dialogue.rival_duel1 plays. Optional:
; nothing in the main story reads the flag except his Act IV last words.
